rem Snippet: Ground Follow
rem Description: Keep an object on a matrix's surface. Call FollowGround(object, matrix, height) after moving the object.

rem Height is how far above the ground the object's origin sits.
function FollowGround(Obj, Matrix, Height#)
   X# = object position x(Obj)
   Z# = object position z(Obj)
   position object Obj, X#, get ground height(Matrix, X#, Z#) + Height#, Z#
endfunction
